{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Dancing Wings - The Aerobatic Simulator",
    "steam_appid": 3728180,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flight simulator dedicated to team aerobatics -- no gun, no missile.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU CAN DO IT SOLO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need anyone else. You can do it solo with the replay overlay function. First, you fly as Lead, and save your replay data. Second, you enter the replay overlay mode, fly as Wingman together with Lead that you previously played as, and save the new replay -- now you have a replay of two aircrafts. You can overlay up to 6 ships.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAINING FROM BASIC TO ADVANCED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game provides various trainings from basic to advanced. The basic level includes level flight, ascend/descend, turn, takeoff and landing. The advanced level teaches you how to fly in a formation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DOWNLOAD/UPLOAD REPLAY OVER INTERNET</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay data can be downloaded from or uploaded to the server. You can join (overlay) the team performance done by someone else in the world, or vice versa.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REALISTIC AERODYNAMICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game employs a realistic aerodynamic simulation of lift, gravity, thrust and drag.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REALISTIC LANDSCAPE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also enjoy the landscape modeled from actual height data of the northeast region in Japan, around Higashi-matsushima city.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Flight simulator dedicated to team aerobatics -- no gun, no missile.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOU CAN DO IT SOLO</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You don't need anyone else. You can do it solo with the replay overlay function. First, you fly as Lead, and save your replay data. Second, you enter the replay overlay mode, fly as Wingman together with Lead that you previously played as, and save the new replay -- now you have a replay of two aircrafts. You can overlay up to 6 ships.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRAINING FROM BASIC TO ADVANCED</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game provides various trainings from basic to advanced. The basic level includes level flight, ascend/descend, turn, takeoff and landing. The advanced level teaches you how to fly in a formation.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >DOWNLOAD/UPLOAD REPLAY OVER INTERNET</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replay data can be downloaded from or uploaded to the server. You can join (overlay) the team performance done by someone else in the world, or vice versa.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REALISTIC AERODYNAMICS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game employs a realistic aerodynamic simulation of lift, gravity, thrust and drag.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >REALISTIC LANDSCAPE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll also enjoy the landscape modeled from actual height data of the northeast region in Japan, around Higashi-matsushima city.</p>",
    "short_description": "Team aerobatics flight simulator - do it solo. Fly, save the replay, fly in overlay mode, save the new replay, and repeat it up to six aircrafts. Realistic aerodynamics and landscape. Step-by-step training. Share your replay online.",
